       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it: amlodipine 30 mg by mouth once daily (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\nI added a note to the order saying the dose is above the usual 10 mg/day maximum and that you confirmed it after the alert. The note also asks for close blood pressure and heart rate monitoring.\n\nPharmacy may contact you to verify the dose. Watch for hypotension, reflex tachycardia, and edema. Give the first dose where vitals can be checked often."
